3. AI-GENERATED 2D IMAGES - CC0 1.0
   The AI-generated poster images in assets/library/source/posters/ (and any
   future AI-generated 2D image) are dedicated to the public domain under
   CC0 1.0 Universal (CC0-1.0). They were generated with OpenAI image
   generation through Codex; each is labelled AI-generated, keeps its
   provenance sidecar (assets/library/source/posters/provenance.json), and shows
   no real brands, logos or trademarks. Attribution is not required.
   This covers the 31 Owner-approved images of art batch 1 in
   assets/library/source/art2d/ (provenance.json and catalog.json included) and
   the contact sheet docs/assets/img/art2d_batch1.jpg. Their text was typeset
   afterwards in Noto Sans JP (SIL OFL 1.1); the font is not committed, only its
   glyphs appear in the images. The guide cat and dog among them are assets,
   not the official mascot (adoption pending a similarity and trademark check).

